# Further LaTeX intermediates. The PDF build uses the real latexmk (see the
# setup chunk in index.rmd), which leaves more behind than tinytex's emulation
# did: .fls and .fdb_latexmk are its file-recorder output and dependency
# database. The index and bibliography intermediates are listed here too, since
# a build interrupted before cleanup leaves them in the repo root.
